# QA report: build-1 (World 1-1 preview)

Build: producer release `build-1` (`build-1.zip`) = game-developer a72265d7d707d5bd7aca34b5360548c458f04d7c + artist 35440031d24312c194d6f420d55e45b8808fe4d4.
Also run on game-developer main 8bbb032 + build-1 assets (to verify the pipe fix).
Method: headless Chromium (Playwright), `file://` load, `?manual` deterministic stepping (`qa/check_build.py`), a joypad bot playing 1-1 (`qa/bot_playthrough.py`), decoded-audio analysis (`qa/audio_check.py`), screenshots viewed by hand.
Scope: P1 (World 1-1). P2/P3 not built yet, not checked.

## Result
- build-1: 82/83 automated checks pass. Fail: G4 zero-length keypress (minor, D-C).
- Bot (build-1): cannot finish 1-1; stuck at the first 4-high pipe (D-A). On 8bbb032 the bot reaches the flag (~frame 1591, score 19200).
- 8bbb032 + assets: 83/83 (the G4 check passes there; D-C stays open, see below), 4-high pipes mountable.
- Audio: all 32 oggs decode, none silent/quiet. Subjective melody fidelity NOT checked (no ear).

